1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,590
(Sheldon:)Sheldon and the Hell Hound.

2
00:00:01,754 --> 00:00:05,594
(Sheldon:)Or How I Lost My Hot Dogs.

3
00:00:09,595 --> 00:00:10,805
Oh, um, ahem.

4
00:00:10,971 --> 00:00:13,851
(Penny:)-I can come back.
-Don't be silly.

5
00:00:14,058 --> 00:00:17,848
We're neighbors. We're gonna run into
each other. May as well get used to it.

6
00:00:18,062 --> 00:00:19,852
(Penny:)Yeah. I guess you're right.

7
00:00:26,403 --> 00:00:27,483
(Leonard:)-Used to it yet?
-Nope.

8
00:00:27,655 --> 00:00:29,075
(Leonard:)Me neither.

9
00:00:30,783 --> 00:00:34,283
Oh. Sheldon seemed to think
I'd be upset about you hanging out.

10
00:00:34,453 --> 00:00:36,203
But I want you to know it's fine.

11
00:00:36,372 --> 00:00:39,252
(Penny:)Oh, good.
Because his mother called me.

12
00:00:41,168 --> 00:00:42,838
(Leonard:)-His mother?
-Yeah, she wants me...

13
00:00:43,003 --> 00:00:45,253
(Penny:)...to take him shopping
for sheets and towels.

14
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:47,970
I was gonna do that.

15
00:00:49,677 --> 00:00:51,467
Oh, well, then you do it.

16
00:00:51,637 --> 00:00:53,517
I don't wanna do it. You can do it.

17
00:00:53,681 --> 00:00:55,721
Okay, then you can take him
for shoes.

18
00:00:55,891 --> 00:00:57,811
(Leonard:)I just took him for shoes.

19
00:00:57,977 --> 00:01:03,027
(Penny:)Well, all I know is he says
they hurt his feet.

